This directory contains code for data analysis

installing the packages:
1. create a venv by running:
    "python -m venv <venv_name>"
2. activate the venv:
    "source <venv_name>/bin/activate"
3. download the packages:
    pip install -r requirements.txt

Running the code:
    python src/dbscan.py <path_to_csv> <dir_to_save_dbscan_results_to> <name_of_file>
    
    This runs Dbscan on the csv file and saves the results to the given 
    directory with the name of the file

    python src/run_data_analysis.py <path_to_csv> <dir_to_save_acf_plots_to>

    This computes the autocorrelation function and partial autocorrelation and
    saves it to the given directory

    time_periods is unused but still in the repo for completeness sake 
